# <type>(<scope>): <subject>          <- imperative, lower case, no trailing period, <=72 chars
#
# <body>                              <- what changed and why; wrap at 72 columns
#
# <footer>                            <- Refs: #123 / BREAKING CHANGE: ...
#
# type:  feat fix docs style refactor perf test build ci chore revert
# scope: facts profiles preflight planner report cli ansible schema ci docs
#
# Conventional Commits. Explain the reasoning, not the diff -- the diff is
# already in the commit. No attribution trailers of any kind.
